<Slide padding={60} style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 72, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: 24, background: '#1E4FA8' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>成果结论 · 交付物与可复核证据</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CADCFC', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>03 · Achievements</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }}></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 497, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 40, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>交付物与可复核证据</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 300, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', gap: 20, marginTop: 8 }}><Box style={{ width: 700, height: 300, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 700, height: 58, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 200 }}>需求规格说明书</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 470 }}>GB/T 9385 口径；.md 单一源 + .docx 验收主件</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 700, height: 58, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 200 }}>答辩演示文稿</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 470 }}>四章 28 页，全部配图取自项目真实资产</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 700, height: 58, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 200 }}>博客园复盘长文</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 470 }}>13 节 + 13 张图，已同步 V1.5.0 口径</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 700, height: 58, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 200 }}>四套回归与证据</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 470 }}>startup / demo / feature / study + 本地与线上 JSON</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 700, height: 58, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 200 }}>自查与说明文档</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 470 }}>自我检查报告 12 节、README 与架构 / 思维导图 / 类图</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 420, height: 300, background: '#1E4FA8', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>三条结论</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.5, margin: 0, marginTop: 14 }}>① 已上线：浏览器直接访问，无需安装与密钥。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.5, margin: 0, marginTop: 8 }}>② 可复核：四套回归结果与 A01 – A39 逐条对应。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.5, margin: 0, marginTop: 8 }}>③ 有边界：无真实厂商 Key、ESP32 未实机、单机单用户原型。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#CADCFC', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 16 }}>边界项一律排除在验收范围外，详见第 04 章。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, marginTop: 12 }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 46, background: '#E8EFF8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: 16 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>复核路径：docs/*_results.json、需求文档 10.5 节；答辩现场可打开线上链接逐项走查。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, marginTop: 10 }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 52, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: 16 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.45, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>章节结论：V1.5.0 是一套可运行、可演示、可逐条验收的课程复习原型；下一章按国标口径给出需求与验收依据。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>AI 校园学习陪伴助手  ·  课程作业答辩</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>21 / 28</Text></Box></Slide>